{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brewers is a chaotic strategy game for up to 4 players. In a world where Wizards and Witches have magically disappeared overnight, it is up to you and your fellow brewers to help defend various castles now that their protection is gone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with up to 4 other brewers to defend various castles from waves of enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.poster.avif?t=1774089266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.webm?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.mp4?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH INGREDIENT CHANGES HOW YOU PLAY THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient has three different effects to add to a potion, where ingredients can buff units, deal explosive damage or spawn new units to help turn the tide on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.poster.avif?t=1774089266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.webm?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.mp4?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/9a7ef0b1f8d10b21a4620a5019926c76.avif?t=1774089266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5+ DIFFERENT WORLDS TO EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 5+ different worlds, where you get to explore new potion ingredients, new friendly and enemy units and different potion dungeons to brew your potions in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/17db66b9409b3d324201a7515fcf20f6.avif?t=1774089266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721000?t=1774089266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/d39900bec32f28d4bae8af455dbaa65df8e2a168/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774089266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/7a801fc79efca1fb143bffe80bf22151add6178d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774089266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/7a801fc79efca1fb143bffe80bf22151add6178d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774089266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brewers is a chaotic strategy game for up to 4 players. In a world where Wizards and Witches have magically disappeared overnight, it is up to you and your fellow brewers to help defend various castles now that their protection is gone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with up to 4 other brewers to defend various castles from waves of enemies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.poster.avif?t=1774089266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.webm?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/8b360d15c602af94da4bb3b8f700f837.mp4?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH INGREDIENT CHANGES HOW YOU PLAY THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient has three different effects to add to a potion, where ingredients can buff units, deal explosive damage or spawn new units to help turn the tide on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.poster.avif?t=1774089266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.webm?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/6c2353157c6ad7b0751d591798146902.mp4?t=1774089266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721000/extras/9a7ef